  "translation": "His neck glows with a darkness like a spread of fully blossomed <b>blue lotuses</b>. I worship him who cut down <b>Kama</b>, the <b>three cities</b> (Tripura), <b>worldly bondage</b>, <b>Daksha's sacrifice</b>, the <b>elephant demon</b>, <b>Andhaka</b>, and <b>Antaka</b>, death itself.",
